Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:05.28,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Mechanical friends, Amicus Robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:08.40,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,A general name for androids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:12.49,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Amicus are imprinted\Nwith the Laws of Respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:14.62,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,To respect human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:17.50,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,To be obedient to human commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:20.58,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,To never attack a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:01:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaev is the father of a university student
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,who was the first victim of the Nightmare\Nof Saint Petersburg and the leader
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Bereaved Family Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It is unclear why he took Sozon's digital clone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but it may be related to the phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.97,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Totoki,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,besides the digital clone,\Nare there any other possibilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.23,0:02:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be able to hold a conversation\Nlike you did if it was a deepfake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The digital clone theory\Nseems convincing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Inspector, I heard from\NCyber-inspection Assistant Lucraft
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,that you asked him to examine\Nthe body of the murdered Amicus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The inspector did nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it of my own accord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The copycat used Sozon's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I could not stand by and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Under normal circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't permit you to investigate\Na case that involves your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can conduct yourself\Nappropriately due to the Laws of Respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Napolov, wouldn't you need\Nthe help of the detective who investigated
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the original case if this is a copycat killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you borrow Assistant Lucraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hieda, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't send an Amicus alone\Nto another agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the special investigation unit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to Inspector Fokine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Echika, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.59,0:03:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I am asking a lot from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber-inspection Assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't say anything about your calculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you I am fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And this was not calculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply remembered Nicolai\Nrequested information from Derevo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is an important case to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They said Inspector Napolov\Nwent to Abaev's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaev was asked to come\Nto police headquarters for questioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but he did not make his appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a bit suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They have already begun\Ntaking Elena's statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's go meet up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicolai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.27,0:04:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I came with Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Nicolai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber-Inspector Hieda,\Nthank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You look good, Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective Lyutov.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Cyber-Inspector Hieda?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to ask you this\Nwhen we just met,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but can you Brain Dive into Elena?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We received her written consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.98,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She says she doesn't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably because she recently\Nincreased her medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sure she ordered the digital clone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but we don't know how involved she is\Nwith this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating Dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, Elena?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel great today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I visited the redevelopment district\Na few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret from Nicolai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you visit Derevo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I couldn't stay like this forever,\Nso I ordered a digital clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to think making something like that\Nwould be making a mockery of Sozon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't be a burden\Nto Nicolai anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't something change\Nif I could talk to Sozon one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Making even a little bit of progress\Nis very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still think about it every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart breaks every time I think\Nabout my daughter's last moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If only they could find the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But the police aren't doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you go cancel\Nthe digital clone order for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.94,0:06:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I thought about it,\NI realized how stupid it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:06:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That paper there is my power of attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:07:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I already signed it,\Nso can you go cancel it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.07,0:07:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena, don't worry about a thing\Nand rest comfortably.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be resting here comfortably.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not while he died in agony, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe Sozon would want you\Nto rest well too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though the killer\Nis still out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena was not involved in the murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, she wanted to cancel\Nher digital clone order.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a strong possibility
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,that Abaev used the power of attorney\Nto get the digital clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that is not enough evidence\Nto suspect him as the copycat killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's enough for us\Nto get a search warrant for his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that thing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked into my memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I deeply apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not mean to make you uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know about this, Nicolai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you trick me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.27,0:08:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the sedative didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Always?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She believes Harold could have\Nsaved my brother from the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful to you, Harold,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,for being with him\Nduring his final moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Napolov sent a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll enter Abaev's home\Nonce we have the warrant,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so he wants Cyber-Inspector Hieda\Nand Assistant Lucraft to be there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see,\Nhis Your Forma was removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the same MO\Nas the Nightmare of Petersburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The fingerprint print matches\Nwith the one from the Amicus murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:35.26,TS/Mask,,0,0,0,,{=8}{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(1736.92,385.54)\p1\c&H30302A&\iclip(m 1742.14 340.28 l 1754.86 374.42 1767.66 365.03 1752.24 331.03)}m -43 31 l 11 -43 20 -19 -31 58
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.59,0:09:35.26,TS/Signs,,0,0,0,,{=8}{\c&HBEC0B8&\blur0.8\fax-0.445740\fscx83.61\fscy48.08\frz58.6571\frx3.9504\fry16.9165\org(1725.74,385.54)\pos(1736.92,385.54)\iclip(m 1742.14 340.28 l 1754.86 374.42 1767.66 365.03 1752.24 331.03)}Police
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The circulation fluid\Nis also consistent with the victim's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The time of death was 2:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.27,0:09:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"Genuine." The antonym of "counterfeit."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a word used to describe\Noriginal artwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But they wrote it\Nwith their non-dominant hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,to avoid identifying themselves\Nby their handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.99,0:10:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely with an artist's paintbrush.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The killer may have\Na strong interest in the arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And there is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sozon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.43,0:10:18.18,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Hey. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a digital clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is evidence he impersonated Sozon\Nto make those calls to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the copycat killer was Abaev.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And his murder is clearly\Nthe Nightmare's retaliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But the information that the police were\Nsuspecting Abaev was never released.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How did the killer know\Nhe was the copycat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.15,0:10:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no signs of a forced entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If we assume the killer is someone\NAbaev is acquainted with,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,then your question is answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But didn't the killer think\Nif they murdered him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:11:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we would find out\Nthe killer is someone Abaev knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The killer most likely could not contain\Ntheir rage towards the copycat killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.17,0:11:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike the previous murders,\Nthis one was very passionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They had never written a message\Nwith the victim's blood before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Nightmare really did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no "if."\NIt was the Nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If Abaev's killer is really\Nthe Nightmare of Petersburg...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be taken off this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can ask Chief Totoki\Nand Inspector Napolov
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.37,0:11:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to withdraw the request for support.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,With this new development,\Nmy assistance will be even more needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The investigation will make\Nprogress even without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,According to what reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.01,0:11:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm against your involvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:12:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Inspector Napolov\Nwants you on this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Echika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how long and how much\NI have been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a chance you won't get any results\Nand will only be left with bad memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am perfectly fine with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know myself very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.43,0:12:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so stubborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Echika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you this worried about me\Nbecause of what I said in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I spoke of my anger towards the killer\Nwhen we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.06,0:12:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I said if Sozon's killer was ever caught,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to punish them\Nwith my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was simply a figure of speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.49,0:12:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,An Amicus Robot bound by\Nthe Laws of Respect
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,can never bring harm to a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,even if they are an RF Model.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wished to express my deep regret\Nfor not being able to save Sozon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...hurt humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just worried about you getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If I am not allowed to join\Nthe investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be extremely hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't agree with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Forensics will still take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go back first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I will stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I also have a request, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Cyber-Inspector Hieda is in shock\Nfrom what she saw at the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If it is not too much trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.89,0:13:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,can you temporarily remove her\Nfrom the investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the Next-generation AI's\Nemotion engine is expressive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.19,0:14:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but that was too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess he's examining the crime scene\Nto his heart's content right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.77,0:14:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.55,0:14:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm personally very worried about\NCyber-inspection Assistant Lucraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.83,0:14:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking Harold to overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But such a good opportunity as this\Nwon't come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're worried about,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but please understand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The current temperature is four degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A thick sweater is recommended.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hieda?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good mor— Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are serious dark circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get any sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because of the real\NNightmare of Petersburg, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it look like you'll find the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not concrete,\Nbut we have an idea of who to look for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure the case will be solved soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back to the special investigation unit soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to talk to\NCyber-inspection Assistant Lucraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.61,0:15:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't you just call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the confiscation\Nof Tosti programs going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.09,0:15:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been helping too,\Nbut nothing's working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to the academy,\Nso I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hi to Harold for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck with your investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When did he disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He left in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I will quickly make my way there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He has been missing since last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nicolai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're meeting with Inspector Napolov,\Nthen I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure I made a request to remove you\Nfrom the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.92,0:16:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We still can't say for sure\Nthat his disappearance
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,is related to the Nightmare of Petersburg,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but his car was abandoned on the shores\Nof a lake 15 minutes from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're searching the lake\Nand its surrounding area now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.76,0:17:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What of his GPS data\Nfrom his Your Forma?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We can assume he has an isolation unit on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means he was most likely kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.87,0:17:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring that thing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Harold will be a great help\Nto our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We also don't want what happened\Nto Sozon to happen to Nicolai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please try to remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to kill Nicolai next?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out! You piece of junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.43,0:17:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find Nicolai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not walk that same path.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you say, it won't change\Nthe fact that you let Sozon die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can still bring Nicolai back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Nicolai say anything before he left?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But Nicolai isn't someone who would go out\Nin the middle of the night to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It had to have been something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! You have to find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose him too, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I said that to Elena,\Nwe have no proof Nicolai is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We might even find his body tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't start losing hope now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help and there's\NInspector Napolov and the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to do everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind words.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber-inspection Assistant,\Nyou go search the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There might be a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.61,0:19:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I pushed you away, Echika.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be sure to let me know\Nif you find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.81,0:20:06.73,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:11.76,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I don't want you anywhere near the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:18.74,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,But who can call Nicolai out\Nwithout raising his suspicions?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.06,0:20:23.31,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,It must be someone acquainted\Nwith both Nicolai and Abaev.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.37,0:20:26.03,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Who could that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:30.00,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,You have a call from a public phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:39.63,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Hieda? I'm glad you picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bigga?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:44.51,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm in a designated dead zone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you skip out on your training?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:52.15,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I might have found something\Nrelated to the Nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:55.86,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.31,0:21:00.15,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I want you to take a look at it with me.\NCan you come to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get Inspector Napolov's\Napproval first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.33,0:21:04.97,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.97,0:21:07.43,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,I called Harold first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.43,0:21:12.96,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,He talked to the inspector about it\Nand said he'd send Echika.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You did great arranging everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should I meet you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:20.24,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,The location is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a message to Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll contact you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:34.00,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Message sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"I might be a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll contact you again."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber-Inspector Hieda's GPS signal\Nwas cut off approximately eight hours ago
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,at a parking lot in Neva District.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That was soon after she sent this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please drive quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:22:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I would not have brought her with me\Nif I thought she could become a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the killer is going after\Nanother law enforcement agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.56,0:22:11.55,Default Italics,,0,0,0,,Echika...
